					<img src="/diceforceITlogo_.gif" alt="Diceforce IT Logo" class="relative w-12 h-12 object-contain" width="48" height="48" />
				</div>
				<span class="text-base font-space tracking-[0.25em] text-cyan-400 font-bold uppercase select-text group-hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">Diceforce IT</span>
			</a>
			<p class="text-neutral-300 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-sm select-text">
				Digital experiences that connect, scale and perform. A creative technology studio for design, strategy, engineering, and enterprise AI solutions.
			</p>
			<span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono text-neutral-400 block pt-2 select-text">
